---
title: "Secuencia - Polling de Cobranzas Aura"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sched as AuraCobranzasScheduled
    participant Svc as CobranzasService
    participant UC as PollCobranzasUseCaseImpl
    participant CoreAdapter as AuraCoreConvenioAdapter
    participant Core as tesoreria-core-service
    participant CobAdapter as AuraCobranzasAdapter
    participant TokenSvc as AuraTokenService
    participant Aura as Aura GIRE API
    participant Prod as AuraPaymentKafkaProducer
    participant Kafka as Apache Kafka

    Sched->>Svc: executePolling(fechaDesde, fechaHasta)
    activate Svc
    Svc->>UC: pollCobranzas(fechaDesde, fechaHasta)
    activate UC

    UC->>CoreAdapter: findActiveConvenios()
    activate CoreAdapter
    CoreAdapter->>Core: GET /api/tesoreria/core/aura/convenio/active
    Core-->>CoreAdapter: convenios activos (DTOs)
    CoreAdapter-->>UC: lista de AuraConvenio
    deactivate CoreAdapter

    loop Por cada convenio activo
        UC->>CobAdapter: fetchCobranzas(numeroConvenio, fechas)
        activate CobAdapter
        CobAdapter->>TokenSvc: getValidToken()
        TokenSvc-->>CobAdapter: bearerToken
        CobAdapter->>Aura: GET /aura-api/v0/cobranzas (nro_empresa, fechas)
        alt Respuesta exitosa
            Aura-->>CobAdapter: items de cobranzas
            CobAdapter->>CobAdapter: mapear a Cobranza + rawPaymentJson
            CobAdapter-->>UC: lista de Cobranza
        else Error de API
            Aura-->>CobAdapter: HTTP Error
            CobAdapter-->>UC: throw RuntimeException (se registra y continua)
        end
        deactivate CobAdapter
        UC->>Prod: publishPaymentEvent(cobranza)
        activate Prod
        Prod->>Kafka: send(aura-payments-topic, clave cpe_debtId, AuraPaymentProcessedEvent)
        deactivate Prod
    end

    UC-->>Svc: totalProcessed
    deactivate UC
    Svc-->>Sched: totalProcessed
    deactivate Svc
